{"3276100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cosmic Crew", "steam_appid": 3276100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276100/extras/d8a295b80afde391bc78a1fbf31df4e1.avif?t=1787195712\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276100/extras_big/d8a295b80afde391bc78a1fbf31df4e1.webp?t=1787195712 width=1560 height=643 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmic Crew</strong> is a physics-based co-op management game for up to four players. It seamlessly blends local and online multiplayer, and supports most common controllers and input devices. Gather your team and keep the space stations up and running!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WORK TOGETHER (OR DON'T)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teamwork may get messy—and that’s part of the fun! Yell, push, and pull your way through the chaos, but keep your crew close. Every extra pair of hands can make—or break—the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276100/extras/f621f22a734c01d02de97a542de3395c.poster.avif?t=1787195712\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276100/extras/f621f22a734c01d02de97a542de3395c.webm?t=1787195712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276100/extras/f621f22a734c01d02de97a542de3395c.mp4?t=1787195712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SEAMLESS LOCAL + ONLINE MULTIPLAYER (UP TO 4 PLAYERS COMBINED)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Same couch or different planets—it doesn’t matter. <strong>Mix local and online</strong> players however you like. Two at your place and two next door? No problem. Jump into a lobby and get started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276100/extras/0255fcfcc39f63213dc69e43874f1b05.poster.avif?t=1787195712\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276100/extras/0255fcfcc39f63213dc69e43874f1b05.webm?t=1787195712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276100/extras/0255fcfcc39f63213dc69e43874f1b05.mp4?t=1787195712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FUNKY PHYSICS AND CONTROLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based movement and interactions? Obviously! Throw objects, get thrown yourself, or land a wild sucker punch or two. Expect unpredictable chaos—we can't guarantee a completely bug-free experience, but we promise it'll be funny. Oh, and don't forget the glorious jiggle physics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276100/extras/b76a8b9718e91baa4b28e60754b870e9.poster.avif?t=1787195712\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276100/extras/b76a8b9718e91baa4b28e60754b870e9.webm?t=1787195712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276100/extras/b76a8b9718e91baa4b28e60754b870e9.mp4?t=1787195712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>KEEP THE STATIONS RUNNING!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amidst all the chaos, you still have a station to run! Carry fresh energy cells to the generators before the power dies. If the juice runs out, the lights go out, so keep moving!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Co-op Gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1–4 Online/Local  Multiplayer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete quests</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable Levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-driven</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Child-friendly (or not)</strong></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276100/extras/d8a295b80afde391bc78a1fbf31df4e1.avif?t=1787195712\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276100/extras_big/d8a295b80afde391bc78a1fbf31df4e1.webp?t=1787195712 width=1560 height=643 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmic Crew</strong> is a physics-based co-op management game for up to four players. It seamlessly blends local and online multiplayer, and supports most common controllers and input devices. Gather your team and keep the space stations up and running!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WORK TOGETHER (OR DON'T)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teamwork may get messy—and that’s part of the fun! Yell, push, and pull your way through the chaos, but keep your crew close. Every extra pair of hands can make—or break—the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276100/extras/f621f22a734c01d02de97a542de3395c.poster.avif?t=1787195712\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276100/extras/f621f22a734c01d02de97a542de3395c.webm?t=1787195712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276100/extras/f621f22a734c01d02de97a542de3395c.mp4?t=1787195712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SEAMLESS LOCAL + ONLINE MULTIPLAYER (UP TO 4 PLAYERS COMBINED)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Same couch or different planets—it doesn’t matter. <strong>Mix local and online</strong> players however you like. Two at your place and two next door? No problem. Jump into a lobby and get started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276100/extras/0255fcfcc39f63213dc69e43874f1b05.poster.avif?t=1787195712\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276100/extras/0255fcfcc39f63213dc69e43874f1b05.webm?t=1787195712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276100/extras/0255fcfcc39f63213dc69e43874f1b05.mp4?t=1787195712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FUNKY PHYSICS AND CONTROLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based movement and interactions? Obviously! Throw objects, get thrown yourself, or land a wild sucker punch or two. Expect unpredictable chaos—we can't guarantee a completely bug-free experience, but we promise it'll be funny. Oh, and don't forget the glorious jiggle physics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276100/extras/b76a8b9718e91baa4b28e60754b870e9.poster.avif?t=1787195712\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276100/extras/b76a8b9718e91baa4b28e60754b870e9.webm?t=1787195712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3276100/extras/b76a8b9718e91baa4b28e60754b870e9.mp4?t=1787195712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>KEEP THE STATIONS RUNNING!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amidst all the chaos, you still have a station to run! Carry fresh energy cells to the generators before the power dies. If the juice runs out, the lights go out, so keep moving!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Co-op Gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1–4 Online/Local  Multiplayer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete quests</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable Levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-driven</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Child-friendly (or not)</strong></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Cosmic Crew is a chaotic couch/online co-op game for up to four players. Coordinate with your crew to move and organize cargo on a busy space station while unpredictable hazards and physics threaten to throw everything into chaos.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Finnish, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps